# Preferred Version Provider (Java)

Phase in a Workflow.getVersion branch by supplying a preferred version for first encounters per execution policy.
See references/core/preferred-version-provider.md.

Recap:
- New executions return maxSupported and record a marker.
- Replay with a marker returns the recorded value.
- Replay without a marker returns DEFAULT_VERSION (-1).

Provider hook:
A provider supplies the value on first encounter and the SDK records it. VERIFY API surface.
Workflow code continues to call Workflow.getVersion and branch on the int.

Observability:
Upsert TemporalChangeVersion yourself to filter running rollouts. See references/java/versioning.md.
